## Notes and Documentation

### Location Conventions

| Content Type | Location |
|--------------|----------|
| **Documentation** | `notes/docs/` - store as `.md` files |
| **Ideas, plans, scratch work** | `notes/scratch/` |

### Rules

- **Docs**: Formal documentation (architecture, API notes, design decisions, how-tos) -> `notes/docs/*.md`
- **Scratch**: Drafts, brainstorming, ad-hoc plans, work-in-progress notes -> `notes/scratch/`

### Examples

```
notes/
  docs/
    architecture.md      # System design, component overview
    api-reference.md     # API notes, endpoints
    setup-guide.md       # How-to documentation
  scratch/
    feature-ideas.md     # Brainstorming, rough plans
    experiment-log.md    # Ad-hoc notes, WIP
```

